I've been playing rangers a lot more lately and have been impressed
with the damage output from fired arrows.  I think that the artifact
selection spoiler:
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/341/art2-341.html
which talks about best artifact selection should show a higher damage
range for the Longbow of Diana.  Specifically, arrows should be
assumed enchanted up to +7 since that is the comparison with other
weapons.  By the time the Quest is complete the hero can easily have
over 200 arrows and with that large a quiver it makes perfect sense to
enchant them all up and even poison them.

So maybe instead of (I hope my columns line up :/
